                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3fd4ced6-f7af-3d0b-b7ce-d547d9c6b95e",
                        "entry_id": "19b934d4-8e06-3f2e-be71-4210685092f9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "iets wat moreel zeer verwerpelijk is"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b0043a62-2e08-4336-8770-e773f4e3d9e5",
                                "sense_id": "3fd4ced6-f7af-3d0b-b7ce-d547d9c6b95e",
                                "text": "Wat de promotie van duurzame mode zeker parten speelt - in negatieve zin - is dat verderfelijke zaken als kinderarbeid, milieuvervuiling en andere misstanden 'onzichtbaar'zijn voor het winkelende publiek. ,,Je ziet aan een shirt in de winkel niet hoe het is gemaakt, zegt Noor Veenhoven van kledingplatform Project Cece. ,,Maar als er niets op het label staat over duurzaamheid of Fairtrade, kun je ervan uitgaan dat het niet goed (genoeg) is."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ff8f33b5-3a4a-4943-a1ed-96b290e16573",
                                "sense_id": "3fd4ced6-f7af-3d0b-b7ce-d547d9c6b95e",
                                "text": "De radicaal-islamitische actiegroep Moslims in Dialoog voert op sociale media campagne tegen medegelovigen die een te gematigd geluid zouden laten horen. Een aantal liberale moslims voelt zich dermate geïntimideerd dat zij aangifte hebben gedaan. Minister Lodewijk Asscher (Integratie, PvdA) noemt de praktijken van de activisten „verderfelijk” en verzekert dat zij op de radar staan van zijn ministerie."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "28af7739-67b0-46e6-a7c9-fcdb8eda34a0",
                        "source_entry_id": "19b934d4-8e06-3f2e-be71-4210685092f9",
                        "source_sense_id": "3fd4ced6-f7af-3d0b-b7ce-d547d9c6b95e",
                        "target_lang_word": "baleful",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "baleful",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "903363e9-78e0-3804-9cd2-c75fbc53a376",
                                        "entry_id": "0a5d2345-0367-399a-ac8e-b64ebf5a7ada",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Portending evil; ominous."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f87b2198-a9cc-4c21-96d3-798d1844ea9e",
                                                "sense_id": "903363e9-78e0-3804-9cd2-c75fbc53a376",
                                                "text": "The street-lamps burn amid the baleful glooms,\nAmidst the soundless solitudes immense\nOf ranged mansions dark and still as tombs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c4343e72-8013-4b16-98aa-f4d308957862",
                                                "sense_id": "903363e9-78e0-3804-9cd2-c75fbc53a376",
                                                "text": "According to them all sorcerers, necromancers and evil-doers were born under the baleful influence of the seventh calendic sign[.]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "515bc3e7-490d-4c24-9127-974e13ea2adc",
                                                "sense_id": "903363e9-78e0-3804-9cd2-c75fbc53a376",
                                                "text": "[…] he went off alone with his family, and, watched by the day's red baleful eye, pumped the pump-car homeward, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fdf63b7f-b200-49c9-bef3-89dc41f0a87a",
                                                "sense_id": "903363e9-78e0-3804-9cd2-c75fbc53a376",
                                                "text": "I learned the speech of birds; now every tree\nScreams out to me a baleful prophecy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1fc8abc6-4b08-4569-b0c2-5afcca1dc5d1",
                                                "sense_id": "903363e9-78e0-3804-9cd2-c75fbc53a376",
                                                "text": "Few people cast a more baleful shadow over postwar Britain than Peter Sutcliffe, the “Yorkshire Ripper”, who has died aged 74"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1355aff-3736-42c5-819b-87ee99fa5bd2",
                                                "sense_id": "903363e9-78e0-3804-9cd2-c75fbc53a376",
                                                "text": "In their excellent essay in The Atlantic endorsing disqualification, Luttig and Tribe remind us that the first president, in his 1796 Farewell Address, had foreseen many of the elements of this baleful disaster."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "88176725-3ac2-34f4-8b58-17e0c5e6cbda",
                                        "entry_id": "0a5d2345-0367-399a-ac8e-b64ebf5a7ada",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Miserable, wretched, distressed, suffering."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e9fd73c-151c-4bb7-afa4-00a094869fbd",
                                                "sense_id": "88176725-3ac2-34f4-8b58-17e0c5e6cbda",
                                                "text": "Thou balefull Messenger, out of my sight:"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5715bbb7-87c5-4e7d-ac0f-330037c629cf",
                                                "sense_id": "88176725-3ac2-34f4-8b58-17e0c5e6cbda",
                                                "text": "round he throws his baleful eyes, that witnessed huge affliction and dismay […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "15b34394-6d9b-34cb-8b75-2294dc32ec7b",
                                        "entry_id": "0a5d2345-0367-399a-ac8e-b64ebf5a7ada",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Deadly, mortal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd31c873-cbab-493d-b3eb-5ada9fe0644e",
                                                "sense_id": "15b34394-6d9b-34cb-8b75-2294dc32ec7b",
                                                "text": "With balefull weedes, and precious Iuiced flowers, / The earth that's Natures mother, is her Tombe,"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c67a7eb1-f8ab-4b2e-980a-f30ff3ba7f2e",
                                                "sense_id": "15b34394-6d9b-34cb-8b75-2294dc32ec7b",
                                                "text": "If some were akin to the Formori of the baleful fogs in Irish mythic history and the Mallt-y-nos, those she-demons of marshy lands immortalised by the Welsh bards, creatures huge and uncouth \"with grey and glaring eyes,\" there were others who exceeded in beauty anything human."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ea624271-0d74-483b-b124-d0ea9f73866a",
                        "source_entry_id": "19b934d4-8e06-3f2e-be71-4210685092f9",
                        "source_sense_id": "3fd4ced6-f7af-3d0b-b7ce-d547d9c6b95e",
                        "target_lang_word": "unwholesome",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unwholesome",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "53100af9-c766-34e1-9f85-534f2dc50da2",
                                        "entry_id": "df320493-d435-3453-b56f-41f1158e6e61",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not wholesome; unfavorable to health; unhealthful."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89017f04-28ee-4056-8727-e4fd8d819756",
                                                "sense_id": "53100af9-c766-34e1-9f85-534f2dc50da2",
                                                "text": "unwholesome air, or food"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1ee448f-5cf8-4857-b159-caba8d35e4b9",
                                                "sense_id": "53100af9-c766-34e1-9f85-534f2dc50da2",
                                                "text": "Caliban: As wicked dewe, as ere my mother bruſh'd / With Rauens feather from vnwholeſome Fen / Drop on you both : A Southweſt blow on yee, / And bliſter you all ore."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee2fb2da-d4c3-4d2a-becf-d93db12ad639",
                                                "sense_id": "53100af9-c766-34e1-9f85-534f2dc50da2",
                                                "text": "Alas! he mastered not his destiny: I have said before, his ashes are in yonder urn. A few unwholesome dews on a summer night were mightier than all his science."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d48550be-46f0-3463-955a-429642ed50ba",
                                        "entry_id": "df320493-d435-3453-b56f-41f1158e6e61",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not sound; tainted; defective."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4a0e58ad-3470-43a3-aa81-0de4bd58af60",
                                                "sense_id": "d48550be-46f0-3463-955a-429642ed50ba",
                                                "text": "There was something indefinably unwholesome about him. Something lean and snakelike."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e792cf71-6e5f-30de-8cbb-5ba9c0c96575",
                                        "entry_id": "df320493-d435-3453-b56f-41f1158e6e61",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Indicating unsound health; characteristic of or suggesting an unsound condition, physical or mental; repulsive; offensive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "11882353-59c0-4fe0-a4e7-57cdeb5c769b",
                        "source_entry_id": "19b934d4-8e06-3f2e-be71-4210685092f9",
                        "source_sense_id": "3fd4ced6-f7af-3d0b-b7ce-d547d9c6b95e",
                        "target_lang_word": "wicked",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "wicked",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dd294d90-7474-308e-9f18-1c4ee04481cf",
                                        "entry_id": "38bf1336-b867-3fb0-8623-450aa6fe610b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Evil or mischievous by nature; morally reprehensible."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25afee03-574d-4356-ac35-a718b2222d61",
                                                "sense_id": "dd294d90-7474-308e-9f18-1c4ee04481cf",
                                                "text": "Genuine cowards follow wicked people and cannot reliably sustain any virtue."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "161ea16a-e728-417b-8d54-47709d885a32",
                                                "sense_id": "dd294d90-7474-308e-9f18-1c4ee04481cf",
                                                "text": "The wicked flee when no man pursueth: but the righteous are bolde as a lyon."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a96a642-8b75-4e15-8269-c4d5d649502f",
                                                "sense_id": "dd294d90-7474-308e-9f18-1c4ee04481cf",
                                                "text": "“Yes,” replied she; “and the saddest part of it all is that she is not marrying the man she loves. Oh, it is terrible. Marrying from a sense of duty! I think it is perfectly wicked, and I told her so.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4dbfc1cc-cb7e-4947-b82c-a209372913c4",
                                                "sense_id": "dd294d90-7474-308e-9f18-1c4ee04481cf",
                                                "text": "‘[…] I remember a lady coming to inspect St. Mary's Home where I was brought up and seeing us all in our lovely Elizabethan uniforms we were so proud of, and bursting into tears all over us because “it was wicked to dress us like charity children”.[…]’."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4894e06c-57ac-49aa-8af8-09ac76d2bc52",
                                                "sense_id": "dd294d90-7474-308e-9f18-1c4ee04481cf",
                                                "text": "What a wicked game to play, to make me feel this way / What a wicked thing to do, to let me dream of you / What a wicked thing to say, you never felt this way"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e1a2d62d-23c1-348d-a883-2f8f86b1c6d5",
                                        "entry_id": "38bf1336-b867-3fb0-8623-450aa6fe610b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Harsh; severe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37cb2687-c97d-48b7-b0ac-10dea588bc91",
                                                "sense_id": "e1a2d62d-23c1-348d-a883-2f8f86b1c6d5",
                                                "text": "wicked wind"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5eef875e-db13-373d-8c84-d441470c56c1",
                                        "entry_id": "38bf1336-b867-3fb0-8623-450aa6fe610b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Excellent; awesome; masterful."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
