                                                "sense_id": "027da306-0ac7-35b5-9635-bc0724ae5e02",
                                                "text": "I didn't really wanna go see On Golden Pond with the fam, but my mom made me go, and I must say that in retrospect it was a wicked expressive film, with a lot of significant meaning."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "821be06f-4715-4912-9219-d6f71bbe990a",
                                                "sense_id": "027da306-0ac7-35b5-9635-bc0724ae5e02",
                                                "text": "The band we went to see the other night was pissah, and they were wicked loud!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46fe36df-9b37-4c74-af56-27fdcd41fcd9",
                                                "sense_id": "027da306-0ac7-35b5-9635-bc0724ae5e02",
                                                "text": "James: It looks like you're wearing earrings also. Those are really something. Those aren't too heavy, are they? / Sonia: No, they're actually, like, wicked light."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
